  The uniform DP constraint in Phase 3a isn't a gap compared to Alpa for normal transformer workloads — it's the same  
  constraint Alpa has, just expressed differently. The only scenario where you'd want to lift it is MoE, which has its
  own dedicated parallelism strategies in both frameworks anyway.                                                     
                  